      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "First, do not deny the core fact, as inconsistencies will damage trust further. Instead, pivot the narrative by framing the vote as a principled stand regarding fiscal responsibility or long-term sustainability. Prepare talking points that emphasize alignment with broader community goals, while clarifying the specific budgetary concerns that led to the decision. This allows you to acknowledge the past decision while controlling the current message.",
